    "description": "Mine (stage 3, gems), level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 841 blocks vs 170 (it holds stages 1 and 2 too). Stage 3 of the mine (gems, tier 7): all of mine 2 (adit, headframe, sorting shed, gold lockup) plus a timber-and-plaster winch house that hauls the hoist rope from the headframe. L2 adds a gem cutter's bench under a pent roof along its front; L3 a yard of raw crystal (amethyst) behind it, barrels of cut gems, purple banners, flower boxes and a sign. Not yet builder-tested: amethyst_cluster, cauldron, coal_block, ladder, rail, raw_iron_block, stonecutter. Decoration step adds: item, item_frame, minecart.",
